  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Development Applications and Milestone map maintained by the Planning department. <span style='color:rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;avenir next&quot;, avenir, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, helvetica, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, roboto, noto, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, cantarell, oxygen, ubuntu, &quot;franklin gothic medium&quot;, &quot;century gothic&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:17px;'>Use the interactive </span><a href='https://portmoody.maps.arcgis.com/apps/webappviewer/index.html?id=e23e7cf6e6504cf48373854344821d3b' style='background:transparent; font-family:Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;avenir next&quot;, avenir, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, helvetica, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, roboto, noto, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, cantarell, oxygen, ubuntu, &quot;franklin gothic medium&quot;, &quot;century gothic&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:17px; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(0, 113, 184); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' target='_blank' rel='nofollow ugc noopener noreferrer'>development applications map</a><span style='color:rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;avenir next&quot;, avenir, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, helvetica, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, roboto, noto, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, cantarell, oxygen, ubuntu, &quot;franklin gothic medium&quot;, &quot;century gothic&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:17px;'> to view details on proposed development projects and the milestones they’ve reached within the review process. New development applications will be added to this map once the application and supporting documents have been reviewed by staff and determined to be complete.</span><p style='margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;avenir next&quot;, avenir, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, &quot;lucida grande&quot;, &quot;helvetica neue&quot;, helvetica, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, roboto, noto, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, cantarell, oxygen, ubuntu, &quot;franklin gothic medium&quot;, &quot;century gothic&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, sans-serif; font-size:17px;'>The map includes a range of development applications under review such as <a href='https://www.portmoody.ca/en/business-and-development/ocp-amendmentrezoning.aspx' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(0, 113, 184); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' rel='nofollow ugc'>rezoning, OCP amendments</a>, <a href='https://www.portmoody.ca/en/business-and-development/subdivision.aspx' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(0, 113, 184); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' rel='nofollow ugc'>subdivision</a>, <a href='https://www.portmoody.ca/en/business-and-development/temporary-use-permit.aspx' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(0, 113, 184); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' rel='nofollow ugc'>temporary use permits</a>, and various types of <a href='https://www.portmoody.ca/en/business-and-development/development-permits.aspx' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(0, 113, 184); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' rel='nofollow ugc'>development permits</a>. Most of these proposals require approval from City Council before they can proceed to <a href='https://www.portmoody.ca/en/home-and-property/building-and-renovating.aspx' style='box-sizing:border-box; background:transparent; color:rgb(0, 113, 184); text-decoration-line:none; font-weight:700;' rel='nofollow ugc'>Building Permit</a>. </p><p style='margin-top:15px; margin-bottom:15px; box-sizing:border-box; color:rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family:Roboto, -apple-system, BlinkM